ared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"agRssYozLGjGEsBZAo1Cbw","review_id":"QqTdj5pcybHU_SWnjbP7WA","date":"2017-01-12T17:03:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9432586431503296,"text_excerpt":"Oh so touristy but still a fun little joint, nonetheless. It's pretty much a must stop for me when I'm in town. Located smack dab in the middle of the Bourbon Street shenanigans, the place has plenty of drinks & drink specials, (like 3 for 1 beers) and Mikey likey the 3 for 1 beer gig. ;-) ;-) ;-) I personally like the patio / courtyard area away from the inside, mainly because it's much quieter out there. Also there is another, well stocked bar out there that is typically much less crowded to boot. A word of advice... Beware of the shooter girls though. The come bearing nasty a$$, overpriced, test tube shots and they can be as relentless as fire ants at a picnic... Avoid at all costs, (u..."},{"business_id":"agRssYozLGjGEsBZAo1Cbw","review_id":"TjiQAPHedDQWa3UElGbtoQ","date":"2018-12-27T16:19:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9385570287704468,"text_excerpt":"This was our favorite spot on Bourbon Street. We tried out so many bars, but this is the one we kept coming back to, to keep the fun going. The band was phenomenal every night we went -- super talented singers and drummer. The DJ wasn't bad either, spinning mostly hip-hip & R&B. The crowd was into it without being obnoxious. There's a ton of space to dance, and outdoor space, too, if you need a breath of fresh air. Bonus: Restrooms were nice and heated (we were here in January, and the heat was greatly appreciated!)"},{"business_id":"agRssYozLGjGEsBZAo1Cbw","review_id":"vBxmUQsrVG2Czqnduevt6Q","date":"2014-07-21T01:47:17","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9350003004074097,"text_excerpt":"This place is fun! We went on a Sunday evening and had a great time. They have 3 for 1 drinks and they're pretty good. They constantly pull people up on stage so it's fun to watch that. It wasn't super crowded and they have an outdoor patio with a bar as well. Fun place to check out."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"agRssYozLGjGEsBZAo1Cbw","photo_id":"rMPYtxKYrFU3ej_E-MDtng","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/rMPYtxKYrFU3ej_E-MDtng.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.893951416015625},{"business_id":"agRssYozLGjGEsBZAo1Cbw","photo_id":"lq0rdnvJSmNX00KI0XBJRw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/lq0rdnvJSmNX00KI0XBJRw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8667860627174377},{"business_id":"agRssYozLGjGEsBZAo1Cbw","photo_id":"7iUoKuRhRjdAtQQsWtSzbA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7iUoKuRhRjdAtQQsWtSzbA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8559389114379883},{"business_id":"agRssYozLGjGEsBZAo1Cbw","photo_id":"hqZxiY-ISxEwXARWH6u7vA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/hqZxiY-ISxEwXARWH6u7vA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8426095247268677},{"business_id":"agRssYozLGjGEsBZAo1Cbw","photo_id":"TrqlA7oraqPrRTSbm0bybg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/TrqlA7oraqPrRTSbm0bybg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.767739474773407}]},"notebook_case":null}
